Created `Services/FileSystemWrapper.cs`. It's a decorator that implements `IFileSystem` by delegating to an inner instance. All properties are `virtual`, so you can subclass it and override only what you need — e.g., to add logging, restrict paths, or inject test behavior.

**Usage:**
```csharp
// Register in DI as-is (delegates to real FileSystem)
services.AddSingleton<IFileSystem>(new FileSystemWrapper(new FileSystem()));

// Or subclass to customize
public class LoggingFileSystem : FileSystemWrapper
{
    public override IFile File => /* wrap with logging */;
}
```
